common='''<section class="d1-panel d1-hide"><h2>Keep a copy</h2><p>Entries stay on this page until you close or reload it. There is no automatic saving or cross-device sync. Download a JSON backup to keep editable entries; import it only into this same worksheet. Entries are not sent by this worksheet to a server.</p><button id="d1-backup" type="button">Download JSON backup</button><label>Import JSON backup (maximum 16 KB)<input id="d1-import" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button id="d1-export" type="button">EXPORT</button><button id="d1-print" type="button">Print / Save PDF</button><button id="d1-clear" type="button">Clear page entries</button><p>Review current inputs before exporting a report. Print / Save PDF opens your browser's print dialog; PDF saving depends on your device. Check paper size and preview. JSON is an editable backup; CSV or HTML is a static output, not an import file for paid products.</p><dialog id="d1-import-dialog"><h2>Replace this worksheet?</h2><p id="d1-import-note"></p><button id="d1-confirm" type="button">Replace entries</button><button id="d1-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button></dialog><dialog id="d1-clear-dialog"><h2>Clear page entries?</h2><p>Downloaded backups will remain on your device.</p><button id="d1-clear-confirm" type="button">Clear entries</button><button id="d1-clear-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button></dialog></section>'''
configs=[dict(slug='adhd-cleaning-planner',title='Free ADHD Cleaning Planner: Small Tasks & Printable PDF',desc='Plan small cleaning tasks with flexible days, estimated minutes and planned, done or skipped status. Free editable worksheet and a two-page printable PDF.',intro='Choose one small action and a flexible day. This planner helps organize tasks; it does not diagnose, treat or promise improvements in ADHD symptoms.',form='''<label>Week / label (required, up to 80 characters)<input id="d1-week" required maxlength="80"></label><div id="d1-rows"></div><button id="d1-add" type="button">Add task</button>''',guide='''<h2>Use a cleaning plan you can restart</h2><ol><li>Add a week label, such as “first week of November.” It does not need to begin on Monday.</li><li>Choose a room and a visible action: “clear one desk corner” rather than “clean the whole office.”</li><li>Estimate 1–180 whole minutes per task. Choose a weekday or Flexible, and keep 1–20 tasks.</li><li>Review the report. Mark each task planned, done or skipped as your choices change.</li><li>Download a backup before leaving the page. Use the PDF for handwriting.</li></ol><h3>What the totals mean</h3><p>Total estimated minutes is the sum of every row, including done and skipped rows. Still planned includes only planned rows. These are estimates, not a timer or a measurement of time actually worked. Changing an entry clears the old report until you review again.</p><h3>Fictional filled example</h3><p>Monday: clear one desk corner, 5 minutes, done. Tuesday: clear sink area, 10 minutes, planned. Friday: fold one small basket, 5 minutes, skipped. Total estimate is 20 minutes: 5 done + 10 still planned + 5 skipped. The PDF includes this example on page 2 and a blank sheet on page 1.</p><h3>When a task is too large</h3><p>Reduce it to a visible next action or choose to skip it. A skipped task is not automatically added to tomorrow. Pick one restart point and use your own available time rather than treating the estimate as a rule.</p><h3>PDF, CSV and online worksheet</h3><p>The downloadable PDF is two static US Letter portrait pages, not a fillable form. Print a blank original or annotate a copy in suitable software. The online worksheet supports JSON backup and a CSV task list; it has no reminders or automatic schedule. No purchase or email signup is required.</p><h3>Related planning</h3><p>Use the <a href="/journal/weekly-planner-2026-free-templates/">undated weekly planner guide</a> for broader commitments. The <a href="/planners/adhd-digital-planner/">paid ADHD Digital Planner</a> is a separate product; check its current listing for features and format.</p>''',export='Download task CSV'),dict(slug='business-plan-cover-page',title='Free Business Plan Cover Page: Editable Layout & PDF',desc='Create a business plan cover page with company, author, recipient, version and a fixed issue date. Download an editable backup, printable HTML or blank PDF.',intro='Prepare a clear front sheet for an existing business plan. Enter your document details, review the preview, and download a standalone HTML page or print it.',form='',guide='''<h2>What belongs on a business plan cover page?</h2><p>Use a recognizable company name, a specific document title, the author or owner, a fixed issue date and a version. Add a recipient, contact and handling note only when needed. This front sheet does not write the business plan or verify its facts.</p><h3>Fill the fields deliberately</h3><p>Company is limited to 100 characters, title 120, subtitle 160, author and recipient 100 each, contact 160, version 40, and classification 100. Company, title, author and a valid issue date are required. Use a fixed date such as 2026-11-04 so an archived file does not silently change date when reopened.</p><h3>Original filled example</h3><p>The fictional Willow Thread cover is titled “Capsule Collection Business Plan,” prepared by “Example owner” for an internal review, version “Draft 1,” issued 2026-11-04. It identifies a draft rather than implying investor approval. Load the example to see the same fields in the preview.</p><h3>Download and printing options</h3><p>JSON preserves editable fields for this worksheet. HTML downloads a standalone static cover page that can be opened in a browser; edit the fields here and export again when details change. The blank PDF is one US Letter portrait writing sheet, not an interactive form. Print / Save PDF opens your browser's dialog. Check the preview because long entries may require a second page.</p><h3>What this cover page does not include</h3><p>There is no logo upload, business-plan generator, legal confidentiality agreement or financial certification. A classification label expresses your intended handling; it does not create an enforceable agreement. Leave unnecessary personal contact details out of public copies.</p><h3>Write the plan behind the cover</h3><p>Start with the customer, offer, evidence, operations, costs, cash and review decisions. Follow the <a href="/journal/fashion-line-business-plan/">fashion line business plan</a>, <a href="/journal/ecommerce-business-plan/">ecommerce plan example</a> or <a href="/journal/recruitment-company-business-plan/">recruitment company plan</a> for worked assumptions. The <a href="https://www.sba.gov/business-guide/plan-your-business/write-your-business-plan">SBA business-plan guidance</a> supplies a broader outline. A polished cover cannot compensate for untested numbers.</p>''',export='Download printable cover HTML')]
for a in configs:
 s=a['slug'];url='https://nexalyplanner.com/tools/'+s+'/'
 if not a['form']:
  lim={'company':100,'title':120,'subtitle':160,'author':100,'recipient':100,'contact':160,'version':40,'issued':10,'classification':100}
  labels={'company':'Company / trading name','title':'Document title','subtitle':'Subtitle / planning period','author':'Prepared by','recipient':'Prepared for','contact':'Contact','version':'Version','issued':'Fixed issue date','classification':'Classification / handling note'}
  a['form']='<div class="d1-grid">'+''.join(f'<label>{labels[k]}'+(' (required)' if k in ['company','title','author','issued'] else '')+f'<input id="d1-{k}" type="'+('date' if k=='issued' else 'text')+f'" maxlength="{n}"'+(' required' if k in ['company','title','author','issued'] else '')+'></label>' for k,n in lim.items())+'</div>'
 schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'WebApplication','name':a['title'].replace('Free ',''),'url':url,'applicationCategory':'ProductivityApplication','operatingSystem':'Web browser','isAccessibleForFree':True,'offers':{'@type':'Offer','price':'0','priceCurrency':'USD'}}
 head=f'<!doctype html><html lang="en-US"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{E(a["title"])}</title><meta name="description" content="{E(a["desc"])}"><link rel="canonical" href="{url}"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css?v=7e6083e6f963"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/day1-planning-tools.css?v=20261104"><script type="application/ld+json">{json.dumps(schema)}</script></head><body>'
 page=head+nav+f'<main class="d1" data-day1="{s}"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/tools/">Free planners</a> / {E(a["title"])}</nav><div class="d1-hide"><p>FREE · NO ACCOUNT NEEDED</p><h1>{E(a["title"])}</h1><p>{a["intro"]}</p><a class="d1-download" href="/downloads/{s}.pdf" download>Download '+('two-page cleaning PDF' if s.startswith('adhd') else 'blank cover PDF')+'</a><p>Published November 4, 2026 · By NexalyPlanner</p><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript for editable entries. The PDF and guide are available without it.</p></noscript></div><section class="d1-panel d1-hide"><h2>Enter your details</h2><form id="d1-form">'+a['form']+'<button type="submit">Review current inputs</button><button id="d1-sample" type="button">Load fictional example</button></form><p id="d1-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section><section class="d1-panel d1-report" aria-labelledby="d1-report-title"><h2 id="d1-report-title">'+('Your task review' if s.startswith('adhd') else 'Your cover preview')+'</h2><div id="d1-result" aria-live="polite"><p>Enter details and review to create a report.</p></div></section>'+common.replace('EXPORT',a['export'])+'<section class="d1-panel d1-hide">'+a['guide']+'</section></main>'+footer+'<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status"></div><script src="/assets/js/main.js?v=cea3f338af06" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/day1-planning-tools.js?v=20261104" defer></script></body></html>'
